@* A section RCL does not inherit Shell's _ViewImports: omitting a line here ships broken
   markup with a green build. Humans.Base is load-bearing — its NonceTagHelper is what lets
   the inline script in _TourLayout run under the CSP. No localizer: Tour is English-only. *@
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@addTagHelper *, Humans.Base
